Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(uniswap-v2): open-world published statement of the
 pair's swap, skim and sync

Verify/ShapeOpen.lean states equivalence, termination and the specification with the
bytecode run among any admitted accounts and the source in every admitted open world
(OpenFunctional, bytecode_any). Contracts/UniswapV2/PairSpec fixes the pair's statement
from solar-verify's exported spec (generated, not committed), composes it from the stage
theorems as named Props (published_of_stages), proves it non-vacuous, binds the export to
the plain compile, and checks the negative controls: an altered jump target, a wrong K
clause and a swap that leaves the reserves unchanged.
