 Contracts/UniswapV2/PairSpec/Stages.lean    |  4 +-
 Contracts/UniswapV2/PairSpec/Statement.lean | 28 ++++++++++++--
 Verify/ShapeOpen.lean                       | 42 ++++++++++++++-------
 4 files changed, 63 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Contracts/UniswapV2/PairSpec/Published.lean b/Contracts/UniswapV2/PairSpec/Published.lean
index 82c9345..89657cf 100644
--- a/Contracts/UniswapV2/PairSpec/Published.lean
+++ b/Contracts/UniswapV2/PairSpec/Published.lean
@@ -42,12 +42,16 @@ theorem published_of_stages (hbound : Bound)
 
 /-- **What the statement gives of the bytes**: in every admitted environment, every result of the
